1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
AI agents need paid data, but the model cannot be trusted with unrestricted wallet control.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:40,000
AgentPay Guard is a zero-trust authorization layer between the model, x402, and the wallet.

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:01:15,000
An MCP-compatible agent requests premium MAD-001 due diligence. Hosted Judge Mode is deterministic and no-spend.

4
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Payee substitution is denied before signing. A consumed transaction is rejected as replay.

5
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:20,000
One existing 2.5 CSPR TransactionV1 completed exactly once and was independently verified on Casper Testnet.

6
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:40,000
The Odra proof recorder is a separate public audit path, not payment settlement, escrow, or custody.

7
00:02:40,000 --> 00:03:00,000
x402 is the payment rail. AgentPay Guard is the authorization layer.
